 exclusive Lovable クレジット and discounts to help them 作成して公開 their プロジェクト."};e.s(["communityEventsPage_support_card1_description",0,MY],224699),e.i(224699);let MJ=(e={},a={})=>{let t=c.experimentalStaticLocale??a.locale??(0,c.getLocale)();return"en"===t||"pt-BR"===t?"communityEventsPage_support_card1_title":"de"===t?"Credits und Rabatte für Teilnehmer":"fr"===t?"Crédits et réductions pour les participants":"es"===t?"Créditos y descuentos para asistentes":"it"===t?"Crediti e sconti per i partecipanti":"hi"===t||"id"===t||"th"===t||"ko"===t?"Credits and discounts for attendees":"クレジット and discounts for attendees"};e.s(["communityEventsPage_support_card1_title",0,MJ],581322),e.i(581322);let MZ=(e={},a={})=>{let t=c.experimentalStaticLocale??a.locale??(0,c.getLocale)();return"en"===t||"pt-BR"===t?"communityEventsPage_support_card2_description":"de"===t?"Greife auf professionell gestaltete Werbematerialien und Schritt-für-Schritt-Event-Hosting-Anleitungen zu, um den Erfolg deines Events sicherzustellen.":"fr"===t?"Accédez à des ressources promotionnelles conçues professionnellement et à des guides pas à pas d'organisation d'événements pour assurer le succès de votre événement.":"es"===t?"Accede a recursos promocionales diseñados profesionalmente y guías paso a paso para organizar eventos que aseguren el éxito de tu evento.":"it"===t?"Accedi ad asset promozionali progettati professionalmente e guide passo passo per organizzare eventi e garantirne il successo.":"hi"===t?"Access professionally designed promotional assets and step-by-step event hosting guides to ensure your event's सफलता.":"id"===t?"Access professionally designed promotional assets and step-by-step event hosting guides to ensure your event's berhasil.":"th"===t?"Access professionally designed promotional assets and step-by-step event hosting guides to ensure your event's สำเร็จ.":"ko"===t?"Access professionally designed promotional assets and step-by-step event hosting guides to ensure your event's 성공.":"Access professionally designed promotional アセット and step-by-step イベント hosting guides to ensure あなたの event's success."};e.s(["communityEventsPage_support_card2_description",0,MZ],947316),e.i(947316);let MX=(e={},a={})=>{let t=c.experimentalStaticLocale??a.locale??(0,c.getLocale)();return"en"===t||"pt-BR"===t?"communityEventsPage_support_card2_title":"de"===t?"Marketingmaterialien und Playbooks":"fr"===t?"Supports marketing et playbooks":"es"===t?"Materiales de marketing y playbooks":"it"===t?"Materiali marketing e playbook":"hi"===t||"id"===t||"th"===t||"ko"===t?"Marketing materials and playbooks":"Marketing materials and playbooksの概要"};e.s(["communityEventsPage_support_card2_title",0,MX],193789),e.i(193789);let M0=(e={},a={})=>{let t=c.experimentalStaticLocale??a.locale??(0,c.getLocale)();return"en"===t||"pt-BR"===t?"communityEventsPage_support_card3_description":"de"===t?"Erhalte Merch-Pakete mit Markenartikeln, die du mit deinen Teilnehmern teilen und dein Event unvergesslich machen kannst.":"fr"===t?"Recevez des packs de swag avec des produits dérivés de marque à partager avec vos participants et rendre votre événement mémorable.":"es"===t?"Recibe packs de swag con mercancía de marca para compartir con tus asistentes y hacer que tu evento sea memorable.":"it"===t?"Ricevi pacchi swag con merchandise brandizzato da condividere con i partecipanti e rendere il tuo evento memorabile.":"hi"===t?"Receive swag packs with branded merchandise to शेयर करें with your attendees and make your event memorable.":"id"===t?"Receive swag packs with branded merchandise to bagikan with your attendees and make your event memorable.":"th"===t?"Receive swag packs with branded merchandise to แชร์ with your attendees and make your event memorable.":"ko"===t?"Receive swag packs with branded merchandise to 공유 with your attendees and make your event memorable.":"Receive swag packs with branded merchandise to 共有 with あなたの attendees and make あなたのイベント memorable."};e.s(["communityEventsPage_support_c