||"de"===t?"referralTerms_terms_oneReward":"fr"===t?"Une récompense par nouvel utilisateur invité. Pas de failles cumulatives : nous sommes des nerds, nous les repérerons.":"es"===t?"Una recompensa por cada nuevo usuario invitado. Sin acumular vacíos legales; somos nerds, lo detectaremos.":"it"===t?"Un premio per ogni nuovo utente invitato. Niente cumuli o scappatoie: siamo nerd, ce ne accorgeremo.":"hi"===t?"One reward per new यूज़र आमंत्रित करेंd. No stacking loopholes - we're nerds, we'll catch it.":"id"===t?"One reward per new pengguna undangd. No stacking loopholes - we're nerds, we'll catch it.":"th"===t?"One reward per new ผู้ใช้ เชิญd. No stacking loopholes - we're nerds, we'll catch it.":"ko"===t?"One reward per new 사용자 초대d. No stacking loopholes - we're nerds, we'll catch it.":"One reward per 新規ユーザー invited. いいえ stacking loopholes - we're nerds, we'll catch it."};e.s(["referralTerms_terms_oneReward",0,Km],153004),e.i(153004);let Kg=(e={},a={})=>{let t=c.experimentalStaticLocale??a.locale??(0,c.getLocale)();return"en"===t||"pt-BR"===t||"de"===t?"referralTerms_terms_rewardsUnlocked":"fr"===t?"Les récompenses sont débloquées une fois que votre invité publie réellement une application. Pas de parrainages fantômes, s'il vous plaît.":"es"===t?"Las recompensas se desbloquean cuando tu invitado realmente publica una app. Nada de referidos fantasma, por favor.":"it"===t?"I premi si sbloccano quando il tuo invitato pubblica davvero un'app. Niente referral fantasma, per favore.":"hi"===t?"Rewards are unlocked once your आमंत्रित करें actually publishes an ऐप. No ghost referrals, please.":"id"===t?"Rewards are unlocked once your undang actually publishes an aplikasi. No ghost referrals, please.":"th"===t?"Rewards are unlocked once your เชิญ actually publishes an แอป. No ghost referrals, please.":"ko"===t?"Rewards are unlocked once your 초대 actually publishes an 앱. No ghost referrals, please.":"Rewards は unlocked once あなたの招待 actually publishes an アプリ. いいえ ghost referrals, please."};e.s(["referralTerms_terms_rewardsUnlocked",0,Kg],79576),e.i(79576);let Kb=(e={},a={})=>{let t=c.experimentalStaticLocale??a.locale??(0,c.getLocale)();return"en"===t||"pt-BR"===t||"de"===t?"referralTerms_terms_rightToChange":"fr"===t?"Nous nous réservons le droit de modifier, suspendre ou mettre fin à ce programme à tout moment. Nous sommes expérimentaux comme ça.":"es"===t?"Nos reservamos el derecho de cambiar, pausar o finalizar este programa en cualquier momento. Así de experimentales somos.":"it"===t?"Ci riserviamo il diritto di modificare, mettere in pausa o terminare questo programma in qualsiasi momento. Siamo sperimentali anche in questo.":"hi"===t||"id"===t||"th"===t||"ko"===t?"We reserve the right to change, pause, or end this program anytime. We're experimental like that.":"We reserve the right to 変更, pause, or end this program anytime. We're experimental like that."};e.s(["referralTerms_terms_rightToChange",0,Kb],551393),e.i(551393);let Kh=(e={},a={})=>{let t=c.experimentalStaticLocale??a.locale??(0,c.getLocale)();return"en"===t||"pt-BR"===t||"de"===t?"referralTerms_terms_sketchyBehavior":"fr"===t?"Si nous soupçonnons un comportement douteux, nous pouvons retenir les récompenses ou désactiver votre lien.":"es"===t?"Si sospechamos de comportamiento sospechoso, podemos retener recompensas o desactivar tu enlace.":"it"===t?"Se sospettiamo comportamenti sospetti, potremmo trattenere i premi o disattivare il tuo link.":"hi"===t||"id"===t||"th"===t||"ko"===t?"If we suspect sketchy behavior, we may withhold rewards or deactivate your link.":"If we suspect sketchy behavior, we may withhold rewards or deactivate あなたのリンク."};e.s(["referralTerms_terms_sketchyBehavior",0,Kh],851407),e.i(851407);let Kv=(e={},a={})=>{let t=c.experimentalStaticLocale??a.locale??(0,c.getLocale)();return"en"===t||"pt-BR"===t||"de"===t?"referralTerms_title":"fr"===t?"Conditions générales":"es"===t?"Términos y condiciones":"it"===t?"Termini e condizioni":"hi"===t||"id"===t||"th"=