ना सकते हैं और AI features व payments जैसी चीज़ें जोड़ सकते हैं।":"id"===t?"Supabase adalah platform lengkap untuk membangun aplikasi dengan autentikasi pengguna, penyimpanan data, dan kemampuan backend lainnya. Menghubungkannya ke proyek Lovable Anda memungkinkan Anda membangun aplikasi yang lebih canggih dan mendukung hal-hal seperti fitur AI dan pembayaran.":"th"===t?"Supabase is a complete platform for สร้างing แอปs with ผู้ใช้ authentication, data storage, and other กลับend capabilities. Connecting it to your Lovable โปรเจกต์ will enable you to สร้าง more advanced แอปs and support things such as AI features and payments.":"ko"===t?"Supabase는 사용자 인증, 데이터 저장소, 백엔드 기능을 갖춘 앱 빌드용 플랫폼입니다. Lovable 프로젝트에 연결하면 더 고급 앱을 빌드하고 AI 기능이나 결제 같은 기능을 지원할 수 있습니다.":"Supabase is a 完了 platform for 作成アプリ with ユーザー authentication, データ storage, and other backend capabilities. Connecting it to あなたの Lovable プロジェクト will 有効化あなた to 作成 more 詳細アプリ and サポート things such as AI features and payments."};e.s(["settings_integrations_supabaseTab_explainer_description",0,$m],202768),e.i(202768);let $g=(e={},a={})=>{let t=c.experimentalStaticLocale??a.locale??(0,c.getLocale)();return"en"===t||"pt-BR"===t||"de"===t?"settings_integrations_supabaseTab_explainer_seeDocs":"fr"===t?"Voir les docs":"es"===t?"Ver documentación":"it"===t?"Vedi documentazione":"hi"===t||"id"===t||"th"===t||"ko"===t?"See docs":"See ドキュメント"};e.s(["settings_integrations_supabaseTab_explainer_seeDocs",0,$g],570092),e.i(570092);let $b=(e={},a={})=>{let t=c.experimentalStaticLocale??a.locale??(0,c.getLocale)();return"en"===t||"pt-BR"===t||"de"===t?"settings_integrations_supabaseTab_explainer_title":"fr"===t?"Qu’est-ce que Supabase ?":"es"===t?"¿Qué es Supabase?":"it"===t?"Cos'è Supabase?":"hi"===t||"id"===t||"th"===t||"ko"===t?"What is Supabase?":"Supabaseとは？"};e.s(["settings_integrations_supabaseTab_explainer_title",0,$b],323040),e.i(323040);let $h=(e={},a={})=>{let t=c.experimentalStaticLocale??a.locale??(0,c.getLocale)();return"en"=